  "content": "[Intro]\n[D5]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[D5]As I fight,\ntrying to escape\nCovering my soul\nWatching the\nflames I must understand\nthis wizard\nFire is every-\n\n[Bridge]\n[A5/E]thing\n\n[Verse 2]\n[E5]It burns\nI provoke It's beyond\nI my fell\nI create light\n\n[Interlude]\n[Ddim]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[D5]Hypnotizing power I\ncan't resist\nReach out my hands I\nfeel the light\nIncrease flames, the\nheat is oppressive\nDisturbs my brain\nI want to dive in\n\n[Bridge]\n[E5]\n\n[Interlude]\n[G5]\n\n[Bridge]\n[G5]\n[F#5]\n[G5]\n[F#5]\n\n[Verse 4]\n[G5]Enter\nnow so deep the flames\n[F#5]I respect the si\nlence\n[G5]Over-\ncome with cold I pray\n[F#5]\nI\n[G5]see\nall the trees, the\n[F#5]sky the grass, the o\nceans\n[G5]I em-\nbrace the world be -\n[F#5]low\n\n[Verse 5]\n[G5]And I\nknow now all the\n[F#5]reasons and all the count\nries\n[G5]Fire\nbegins and fire ends\n[F#5]\n\n[Bridge]\n[E5]\nOh\nit\nburns,\nfire\nis\nall\n\n[Interlude]\n[Ddim]\n\n[Outro]\n[E5]",
